      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Am\u012bn al-Dawla, 20;</li>\n<li>\nAl-Sha\u02bf\u02bf\u0101r\u012bn, 20.\n</li>\n<li>\nThe daughter of Ab\u016b\u02bel-Faraj, 20.\n</li>\n<li>\nAl-Rayyis Ab\u016b\u02bel-Najam, 15.\n</li>\n<li>\nAl-N\u0113zer, 50.\n</li>\n<li>\nOur Master, al-Rayyis Ab\u016b\u2019l-Bay\u0101n, 5.\n</li>\n<li>\nAl-Shaykh \u016b Na\u1e63r, 5.\n</li>\n<li>\nAl-Yat\u012bm, 3.\n</li>\n<li>\nAl-\u0100h\u016bv, 2.\n</li>\n<li>\nThe judges, 96.\n</li>\n<li>\n\u1e24ikr, 3. 5 musicians, 9.\n</li>\n<li>\nOil for the synagogue, for \u1e62afar, 30.\n</li>\n<li>\nD\u0101r al-Turk\u012b\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\n(in) al-Jaz\u012bra, for 3 months, 4.\n</li>\n<li>\nThe q\u0101\u02bfa, 22. The storeroom, 6.\n</li>\n<li>\nD\u0101r al-Surr\u012bya, for three months,\n</li>\n<li>\nplus a tip, 4. From the funduq of (al-) S\u016bq al-Kab\u012br, 3.\n</li>\n<li>\nFrom al-Mask\u012bl, 2.\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
